#* {{quote-journal|1=en|year=2018|author=James Lambert|title=Setting the Record Straight: An In-depth Examination of ''Hobson-Jobson''|journal=International Journal of Lexicography|volume=31|issue=4|doi=https://doi.org/10.1093/ijl/ecy010|page=491|text=The citations are set in smaller font, start on a new indented line and are '''headed''' with a date.}}
